#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/7.appendix/6.decisions/changes/index.md:3
#: e65fb063c6f147fbabf039e7ce6f5fdc
msgid ""
"This directory contains PKB-local change proposals following the OpenSpec"
" workflow. Repository-level proposals under `openspec/changes/` are a "
"separate source tree and are not included in this Sphinx site; link or "
"summarize them here when they need to be discoverable to PKB readers."
msgstr ""
"此目录包含遵循 OpenSpec 工作流的 PKB 本地变更提案。`openspec/changes/` 下的仓库级提案属于独立源树，不包含在此 "
"Sphinx 站点中；如果需要让 PKB 读者发现它们，请在此处链接或摘要说明。"

